      "text": "Every Sunday, Lolo Ben goes fishing on the Agusan River. He wakes up early and packs rice, a bottle of water and his fishing net. His grandson Paolo goes with him. Paolo sits at the front of the small boat. The river is calm and quiet. After an hour, Lolo feels a strong pull on the net. Paolo helps him pull it up. They catch five big fish! On the way home, they give two fish to their neighbor, Aling Rosa. She thanks them with a big smile."}
